'''Tapu Lele''' (Japanese: '''カプ・テテフ''' ''Kapu-Tetefu'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

