==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM-P Promo|Tapu Lele|152}}, one of the {{TCG|SM-P Promotional cards}} released only in Japan.
*'''Energy Arrow''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Latias|153}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

